---
// Values come from the output shown in the post: [1 99 3 4] [99 3] after b[0] = 99.
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
---
<figure class="gp03c">
  <div class="gp03c-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 240" role="img" aria-label="The slice a holds 1, 99, 3, 4. The slice b is a window onto the cells at index 1 and 2 of a, so b[0] is the same cell as a[1].">
<text x="20" y="85" class="strong">a</text>
    <DiagramIcon name="heap" x={62} y={80} size={26} />
    <text x="240" y="52" text-anchor="middle" class="mut">0</text>
    <rect x="200" y="62" width="80" height="44" rx="4" class="cell" />
    <text x="240.0" y="89.0" text-anchor="middle" class="num">1</text>
    <text x="320" y="52" text-anchor="middle" class="mut">1</text>
    <rect x="280" y="62" width="80" height="44" rx="4" class="cell hot" />
    <text x="320.0" y="89.0" text-anchor="middle" class="num hot">99</text>
    <text x="400" y="52" text-anchor="middle" class="mut">2</text>
    <rect x="360" y="62" width="80" height="44" rx="4" class="cell" />
    <text x="400.0" y="89.0" text-anchor="middle" class="num">3</text>
    <text x="480" y="52" text-anchor="middle" class="mut">3</text>
    <rect x="440" y="62" width="80" height="44" rx="4" class="cell" />
    <text x="480.0" y="89.0" text-anchor="middle" class="num">4</text>
    <text x="20" y="200" class="strong">b := a[1:3]</text>
    <DiagramIcon name="search" x={150} y={195} size={26} />
    <line x1="320" x2="320" y1="148" y2="108" class="ln dash hot fm-flow" />
    <rect x="280" y="150" width="80" height="44" rx="4" class="cell hot fm-pulse" />
    <text x="320.0" y="177.0" text-anchor="middle" class="num hot">99</text>
    <text x="320" y="216" text-anchor="middle" class="mut">b[0]</text>
    <line x1="400" x2="400" y1="108" y2="148" class="ln dash" />
    <rect x="360" y="150" width="80" height="44" rx="4" class="cell" />
    <text x="400.0" y="177.0" text-anchor="middle" class="num">3</text>
    <text x="400" y="216" text-anchor="middle" class="mut">b[1]</text>
    <text x="570" y="128" class="hot"><tspan data-lang-en>b[0] and a[1] are the same cell</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>b[0] và a[1] là cùng một ô</tspan></text>
    <text x="570" y="172" class="mut"><tspan data-lang-en>b has no numbers of its own;</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>b không có số riêng;</tspan></text>
    <text x="570" y="192" class="mut"><tspan data-lang-en>it is a window onto a.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>nó là một khung nhìn vào a.</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>After b[0] = 99, a shows [1 99 3 4] and b shows [99 3]. Cutting a slice does not copy: b is a window onto cells 1 and 2 of a.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Sau b[0] = 99, a là [1 99 3 4] còn b là [99 3]. Cắt slice không sao chép: b là một khung nhìn vào ô 1 và 2 của a.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gp03c { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gp03c-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gp03c svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .gp03c text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .gp03c .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp03c .mut { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp03c .strong { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp03c .num { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp03c .cell { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp03c .cell.free { fill: none; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; stroke: var(--border); }
  .gp03c .cell.hot { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); }
  .gp03c text.hot { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .gp03c .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp03c .box.hot { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); }
  .gp03c .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; fill: none; }
  .gp03c .ln.thin { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .gp03c .ln.dash { stroke-dasharray: 3 4; }
  .gp03c .ln.hot { stroke: var(--red); }
  .gp03c .hd { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp03c .hd.hot { fill: var(--red); }
  .gp03c figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
